title: "On Time Prayer (على وقتها): an open reconstruction of the Umm al-Qura prayer times"
abstract: "An open, dependency-free formula that reproduces, to the minute, the prayer times shown by the official Umm al-Qura calendar website, verified on 14,657,797 server values."
type: software
authors:
